An explicitly empty stack shows just `order`, and selects the first discovery
result rather than preferring recency.

    :t respawn-pane -k -t runner:0 'smth --order ""; cat' (success)
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k C-p
    :snap --color

```terminal
session:                                                                                           ┃
  3/3 | [M-s] order | [C-r] repo: none                                                             ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
▌■ alpha                                                                                           ┃
 ■ beta                                                                                            ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                          ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                           ┃
```

![light](session-ordering.md.snap.15.light.svg)
![dark](session-ordering.md.snap.15.dark.svg)

All-disabled entry selects live; enabling it does not revive any other key.
Escape exits the application rather than accepting pending edits.

    :k M-s l
    :snap --color

```terminal
session:                                                                                           ┃
  3/3 | [M-s] ◂ ↓live ▸ recency · name · attention   | [C-r] repo: none                            ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
▌■ alpha                                                                                           ┃
 ■ beta                                                                                            ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                          ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
